== Notes ==

*This feat never gives a penalty to AC for a negative wisdom modifier.
*Monks do not lose this AC bonus when they become [[flat-foot]]ed.
*Monks do lose this AC bonus when wearing [[armor]] or using a [[shield]].

==Builder notes==

'''Item feat:''' No, but it can be added with custom content.

==Custom content notes==

'''Removable:''' yes

'''Reusable:''' No, it is linked to the monk class.

'''Script:''' hardcoded

*This feat can be added to [[iprp_feats.2da]] to make it available as an item feat. However, it will only work for monks, so it is pointless unless the feat progress table is changed.